## 1. Current State (Ant-based)

The build is orchestrated by **Apache Ant** (`Build/build.xml`).
Ant calls tools in this order:

```
Ant
 ├── CMake          → generates Visual Studio .sln / .vcxproj files
 ├── MSBuild        → compiles C++ source using those project files
 ├── Boost.Test     → runs unit tests, writes XML reports to log/
 └── PC-lint Plus   → runs static analysis, writes reports to construct/LintResults/
```

### Ant Targets (current)

| Target               | Description                                          |
|----------------------|------------------------------------------------------|
| `ci`                 | Clean logs → init → cmake configure → msbuild        |
| `ci_with_unittest`   | Same as `ci` + run all unit tests                    |
| `all`                | Full nightly: clean, version bump, build, setup, package, uitest, unittest, commit |
| `lint`               | Clean → cmake configure → create lint cfg → run lint (PA projects) |
| `lint.misc.components` | Same as `lint` but for misc/shared components      |

### Projects Covered

**Main build:** `PlanningAssistant.sln` (entire solution)

**Unit test modules (7):**
- `PlanningAssistant.Test`
- `PlanningAssistantData.Test`
- `PlanningAssistantInterfaces.Test`
- `PlanningAssistantModels.Test`
- `PlanningAssistantSettings.Test`
- `DeviceInterfaces.Test`
- `FemtoPlanningInterfaces.Test`

