## 6. Agent Pool Requirements

All pipelines require a **self-hosted Windows agent** with the following software installed:

| Tool                        | Version              | Notes                                             |
|-----------------------------|----------------------|---------------------------------------------------|
| Windows OS                  | Windows 10/Server    | 64-bit                                            |
| Visual Studio               | 2022 (Professional) | Required for MSVC compiler + MSBuild              |
| CMake                       | ≥ 3.5                | Must be on PATH                                   |
| Apache Ant                  | ≥ 1.10               | Must be on PATH; needs Java                       |
| Java (JDK)                  | ≥ 11                 | Required by Ant                                   |
| Python                      | ≥ 3.x                | Used by `build_externals_compare.py`              |
| PC-lint Plus                | Current              | Only on agents used for lint pipelines            |
| Qt                          | Matching project ver | Required for CMake Qt discovery                   |
| Boost                       | Matching project ver | Required for compilation and unit tests           |

**Suggested pool name:** `pa-windows-build-agents`

